- [x] Confirmed anonymous access path on MissingAuth (crates/server/src/http/mod.rs:307-334).
- [x] Confirmed authorize_bucket_read/write call head_bucket before permission checks (crates/server/src/http/mod.rs:373-396).
- [x] Confirmed head_bucket maps missing bucket to ServerError::BucketNotFound (crates/server/src/coordinator.rs:236-239).
